+Technicians enter an equipment serial number and need its calibration date, due date, and equipment description. A signed snapshot contains newline-delimited JSON records, a schema version, a snapshot date, and a signature manifest. Kiosks have no network route during normal operation, so the registry serves every lookup from kiosk-local files.
 
